{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1114763-question-about-short-stats","id":1114763,"title":"Question about \"short\" stats","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-11T14:49:20-07:00","id":1114763,"title":"Question about \"short\" stats","content":"So, I got a hold of the anchor\u00b4s sheet (Hell is other people) from Mr Gone. I noticed in wonder that there are &quot;short&quot; versions of the traits, namely &quot;Physical&quot;, &quot;Social&quot; and &quot;Mental&quot;. I figured I could maybe save myself some time. Are there special rules for it and in what book can I find them? Is there a &quot;short&quot; way of defining the stats, or do they want to put the normal starting dots (5/4/3) in it?<br /> <br /> Would be grateful if someone can point me a book, if it can be found. I have nearly all of them.<br /> <br /> Keep on gaming,<br /> <br /> Dennis","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13653-narr666","name":"Narr666","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T15:39:14-07:00","id":1114788,"title":"","content":"Those are usually just another axis of categories,but certain beings,mostly ephemerals (ghosts, spirits and such) use those simplified 3 Attributes because their body,mind and soul are all a sigle continuum.<br /> <br /> If you want to simplify CC and use them, there's no problem initially, but certain powers like the physical Disciplines would be wonky to adjudicate, due to its constant boosts of what is, essentially, just a &quot;third&quot; of one of those Attributes.<br /> <br /> Regarding the dot distribution, you probably need to limit it to about 4 dots to split between them, to keep things average. Also consider increasing the cost in experiences by 1 or 2 xp apiece (so 6-7 per dot)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T15:50:10-07:00","id":1114791,"title":"","content":"That\u00b4s a bit strange. These &quot;anchors&quot; are exclusively human.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13653-narr666","name":"Narr666","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T08:04:24-07:00","id":1115095,"title":"","content":"There are also suggestions to use the Simplified traits for less important (stat's wise at least) NPCs of any kind. I am not sure where those rules are in the books though. Danse Macabre maybe? Since that's where the Hell is Other People hack is from.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T08:35:39-07:00","id":1115102,"title":"","content":"Yes, but I didn\u00b4t find it there. Maybe I was not looking close enough. If someone knows rules about them, I would be grateful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13653-narr666","name":"Narr666","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-14T04:54:22-07:00","id":1115884,"title":"","content":"Try checking out Mirrors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","name":"Justin Sane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-22T08:18:19-07:00","id":1119249,"title":"","content":"Oh, no I got it! Beneath the documents you can find the rules for making them. But there are 8 points. That\u00b4s too much, isn\u00b4t it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13653-narr666","name":"Narr666","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-24T14:49:18-07:00","id":1120087,"title":"","content":"nah it's ok. Two points though:<br /> <br /> 1. Each line represents an aggreate of three traits normally, so they would be a bit higher.<br /> 2. This is importnat. Unlike full player character style atributes, these don't get a free dot automatically in each stat. They start at 0.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-25T13:59:22-07:00","id":1120478,"title":"","content":"I would say 7 is better. 8 means i.e. 4/2/2 or 3/3/2. If I look at the average stats, that seems a bit much. Look at possibilities with seven: 4/2/1 or 3/2/2. Feels more like an average CoD Character, doesn\u00b4t it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13653-narr666","name":"Narr666","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-25T15:53:09-07:00","id":1120529,"title":"","content":"It's from the <b>Requiem Chronicler's Guide</b>. Rules can be found there!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> 